------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STATES (presentational primitive -- parity with the web source)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
WidgetGaugeHero.tsx fetches nothing (its only dependency is the RadialGauge
chart), so -- exactly like the shipped sibling primitives HighlightCard/ToolCard
-- the data-bound phases (loading/error/stale/offline) belong to the embedding
widget, NOT to this primitive. Every branch the web source actually carries is
reproduced and unit-tested through the pure GaugeHeroProjection:
  - data     : gauge arc + centre value/unit + label (web RadialGauge).
  - compact  : size switch 70 vs 100 (web compact?70:100); stats and children
               slot suppressed (web "not-compact AND ...").
  - stats    : wrapping, centred stats row (web "not-compact AND stats.length>0").
  - children : optional slot (web "not-compact AND children").
  - empty    : non-finite value or max<=0 renders the em-dash centre + "No data"
               VoiceOver value -- never a broken/blank arc (the honest empty branch).

